WEBVTT

00:04.270 --> 00:07.440
The shining time...

00:08.610 --> 00:16.160
...I have always imagined.

00:25.120 --> 00:30.250
Something will change tomorrow.

00:32.340 --> 00:38.640
I can sense it.

00:39.810 --> 00:46.900
In a mirage, I wait until you come.

00:47.190 --> 00:54.860
I walk briskly through the brightly lit streets.

00:55.780 --> 01:01.870
You've run so far.

01:02.950 --> 01:10.130
So I felt the air of your love.

01:10.340 --> 01:16.340
Soon after I see you,

01:17.680 --> 01:23.640
my stolen heart beats.

01:42.990 --> 01:48.000
Geez! I'm gonna be late again for school because of you! C'mon, run!

01:48.750 --> 01:52.960
I didn't ask you to wait for me. You should have just gone ahead.

01:52.960 --> 01:55.170
If I had, you'd be late for school.

01:55.170 --> 01:58.510
And don't you also have flower duty this morning?

01:59.220 --> 02:02.510
Oh, that's right! I'll take a shortcut!

02:02.510 --> 02:06.060
Huh? Maron, you're trespassing you know!

02:07.060 --> 02:08.440
Ni-san, good morning.

02:09.690 --> 02:11.810
Miyako, I'm going on ahead!

02:13.150 --> 02:15.360
Oh, Maron...

02:25.410 --> 02:27.750
Stop it!

02:30.670 --> 02:31.540
Oh no!

02:40.890 --> 02:43.470
That was close! Are you okay?

02:49.230 --> 02:51.480
That was dangerous. Let's go!

02:51.480 --> 02:54.020
Papa...that hurts.

02:54.020 --> 02:56.530
It's punishment for playing with the bike.

02:57.400 --> 03:00.030
Maron! What are you doing there?!

03:00.030 --> 03:01.990
You're going to be late for school!

03:02.370 --> 03:04.410
Oh... Yeah...

03:05.450 --> 03:08.410
Hey, let's go. Hurry!

03:10.290 --> 03:16.960
The Target Is the Family Bond?!

03:25.390 --> 03:27.310
Hey, don't run in the hall!

03:29.180 --> 03:30.980
You're late! Late!

03:34.110 --> 03:34.860
Yo!

03:35.610 --> 03:37.150
You're the one from yesterday...

03:37.650 --> 03:40.070
<i>Especially because of the nice view.</i>

03:44.370 --> 03:47.030
You're the "panty" guy!

03:47.620 --> 03:51.250
What? Don't say such nasty things!

03:51.250 --> 03:53.580
He's a new student...

03:53.580 --> 03:56.340
Nagoya Chiaki. Nice to meet ya.

03:56.340 --> 03:59.460
It's nice to meet you, too. I'm Toudaiji Miyako.

03:59.460 --> 04:01.760
Oh yeah, this is Kusakabe Maron.

04:01.760 --> 04:04.840
He's going to the same school as us. This is the best!

04:04.840 --> 04:06.430
This is the worst!

04:06.430 --> 04:09.100
Take your seat.

04:09.100 --> 04:09.810
Sure.

04:12.770 --> 04:15.060
<i>Can't be, can't be, can't be...</i>

04:18.440 --> 04:20.190
What color are they today?

04:20.190 --> 04:21.070
What do you mean?

04:21.690 --> 04:22.860
Your pan-ties.

04:26.320 --> 04:27.620
They're red.

04:27.620 --> 04:29.660
What are you doing?!

04:29.660 --> 04:33.710
I haven't gotten this school's textbooks and stationery, either.

04:33.710 --> 04:36.420
Let's start class.

04:38.250 --> 04:39.590
What?

04:39.590 --> 04:42.170
You're cute. Do you want to go out with me?

04:42.720 --> 04:45.640
<i>What a skirt-chaser he is!</i>

04:48.100 --> 04:50.430
Kusakabe... Be serious!

04:52.390 --> 04:55.020
<i>Why does this always happen to me?</i>

05:04.280 --> 05:07.530
Hey, Maron. You're not doing it correctly.

05:07.530 --> 05:10.530
At this point, you have to lift your leg at a 120 degree angle.

05:10.530 --> 05:12.830
I'm doing it properly.

05:12.830 --> 05:15.960
You're mistaken. Okay, don't move.

05:18.710 --> 05:26.800
- See, it's only 100 degrees. 120 degrees is like THIS...

05:23.670 --> 05:26.800
- Ouch, that hurts, Miyako!

05:27.380 --> 05:30.930
Why are you so mad? You're acting weird today.

05:30.930 --> 05:35.310
If you put your hand on your heart and think deeper, you'll understand.

05:35.310 --> 05:36.640
Hmm...

05:38.600 --> 05:39.650
I don't get it.

05:39.650 --> 05:41.980
It's because of Nagoya Chiaki-kun.

05:41.980 --> 05:44.530
You flirted with him too much.

05:44.530 --> 05:47.530
No way! I don't care about him!

05:47.530 --> 05:50.870
Hey Maron, are you sure you're not interested in him?

05:51.530 --> 05:53.870
Of course I'm not.

05:54.080 --> 05:56.500
Then I can go after him.

05:56.500 --> 05:57.580
Why...?

06:03.420 --> 06:05.800
<i>He's such a pervert.</i>

06:12.350 --> 06:13.810
<i>Just you watch me!</i>

06:21.270 --> 06:22.860
Please come back!

06:29.740 --> 06:30.950
That was close.

06:32.120 --> 06:33.240
Good afternoon.

06:33.240 --> 06:36.500
Hello. Well... I wanted to thank you for this morning.

06:36.500 --> 06:39.540
Don't mention it. But why are you here?

06:39.540 --> 06:44.170
Today's classes are over, but... I didn't want to go home.

06:44.170 --> 06:46.050
I saw you from my house.

06:47.210 --> 06:50.800
I want to be a gymnast like you, Onee-chan.

06:50.800 --> 06:52.010
Oh?

06:52.010 --> 06:56.770
I wanted to join the club, but Papa didn't want...

06:58.560 --> 07:01.060
Is your Papa always that angry?

07:01.060 --> 07:04.150
No, he used to be very kind.

07:04.150 --> 07:07.650
But now he always abuses Mama.

07:07.650 --> 07:12.110
He shouts and hits. Papa was kinder before.

07:15.580 --> 07:19.830
<i>Stop, don't fight! Stop!</i>

07:21.870 --> 07:24.250
What's wrong, Onee-chan?

07:24.250 --> 07:26.460
Oh...nothing.

07:26.460 --> 07:29.300
Hey, it's kind of cold out here. Want to come inside?

07:29.300 --> 07:33.090
No... I have to go home, or else Papa will get mad at me.

07:33.090 --> 07:34.930
Is he at home?

07:35.220 --> 07:38.560
Yes...he quit his job.

07:38.560 --> 07:40.890
Is it okay for me to come again?

07:41.350 --> 07:42.600
Yes, it's fine.

07:42.600 --> 07:44.600
Well, bye bye.

07:46.190 --> 07:49.820
Oh...you can be nice sometimes too, huh?

07:52.610 --> 07:55.160
What? Were you eavesdropping on us?

07:56.240 --> 07:58.080
Nope. I was just watching you guys.

08:00.370 --> 08:03.000
You have a nice figure.

08:03.000 --> 08:05.000
Stop it, you pervert!

08:07.880 --> 08:10.090
You also look cute when you're mad.

08:10.090 --> 08:11.880
Maron?

08:13.630 --> 08:14.390
Yo!

08:14.390 --> 08:16.300
Chiaki-kun!

08:17.350 --> 08:21.270
What are you doing? Practice isn't over yet!

08:21.270 --> 08:23.270
I know that.

08:23.270 --> 08:25.730
So you belong to the same club?

08:25.730 --> 08:27.940
Huh? Yes!

08:27.940 --> 08:29.270
When's practice over?

08:29.270 --> 08:30.650
At 5:30 P.M.

08:30.650 --> 08:33.110
Then, I'll wait for you guys. Let's go home together.

08:33.110 --> 08:35.280
Really?! LUCKY!

08:44.210 --> 08:46.170
Gymnastics...

08:50.050 --> 08:51.590
Ouch...

08:56.970 --> 08:59.050
Hey, is gymnastics fun?

08:59.050 --> 09:00.390
Not really.

09:00.390 --> 09:02.350
Hey, listen.

09:02.350 --> 09:06.150
I'm doing gymnastics to enhance my body's flexibility.

09:06.150 --> 09:10.320
In order to catch Kaitou Jeanne, you have to move your body quickly.

09:10.320 --> 09:11.650
And you, Maron?

09:11.650 --> 09:14.320
Don't address me just with my first name.

09:14.320 --> 09:16.410
I don't mind. Just call me "Chiaki."

09:16.410 --> 09:17.450
That's okay, right, Miyako?

09:17.450 --> 09:21.450
Of course! You're a classmate and you live in the same apartment.

09:24.410 --> 09:26.000
After you, ladies.

09:26.000 --> 09:29.080
Wow, this looks cool! Maron, hurry up!

09:29.080 --> 09:31.050
You guys go ahead.

09:31.050 --> 09:33.090
Oh, really? Lucky!

09:44.640 --> 09:45.600
I'm home...

09:49.690 --> 09:51.360
I feel depressed.

09:53.440 --> 09:56.150
Tomorrow will be better than today.

09:58.570 --> 10:00.280
Allllllllll right!

10:00.280 --> 10:03.040
One, two, three, four...

10:03.040 --> 10:04.500
What are you doing?

10:05.540 --> 10:07.160
Nothing.

10:07.160 --> 10:09.790
You're my next-door neighbor?

10:09.790 --> 10:15.090
I guess so. It's a pretty good apartment and an especially nice view.

10:15.090 --> 10:17.720
Well, we are on the 7th floor...

10:17.720 --> 10:20.340
I didn't mean the "scenery."

10:21.970 --> 10:23.260
What?

10:27.640 --> 10:30.850
<i>Why does it always end up like this?</i>

10:31.360 --> 10:34.730
<i>I hate this...!</i>

10:41.450 --> 10:44.200
Hello, Maron. I'm home!

10:44.200 --> 10:46.330
Where have you been, Fin?!

10:46.330 --> 10:49.620
Do the cleaning later. You have a new assignment.

10:49.620 --> 10:52.750
I refuse. I don't feel like doing it today.

10:55.750 --> 10:59.090
A Demon is hiding in a picture again.

10:59.090 --> 11:01.390
I still don't feel like doing it today.

11:01.390 --> 11:05.390
Because of a Demon, a family is about to be driven apart.

11:08.560 --> 11:10.140
A family?

11:10.140 --> 11:12.350
This is the family in question:

11:13.520 --> 11:14.900
This is...

11:16.400 --> 11:17.360
Hiromi-chan...

11:17.360 --> 11:19.320
Eh? How do you know her?

11:19.320 --> 11:20.950
I'll explain later. Take me there!

11:20.950 --> 11:22.110
That's the spirit!

11:26.910 --> 11:29.410
Hey Maron, where are you going?

11:31.710 --> 11:34.750
Where? Um... I'm just going for a walk...

11:34.750 --> 11:38.170
We've gotten a notice card from Kaitou Jeanne again.

11:38.170 --> 11:43.430
But it's kind of weird. The target is a picture drawn by an elementary school girl.

11:43.430 --> 11:45.390
What in the world is she planning?

11:45.390 --> 11:48.390
Wh... Who knows...

11:48.390 --> 11:51.890
Anyway, I'm going to join Dad's team now.

11:51.890 --> 11:54.400
I'm going to catch her tonight!

11:54.400 --> 11:56.320
You're really pumped tonight.

11:56.320 --> 12:00.490
Of course. This time my trap's perfect. See ya, I'm in a hurry.

12:05.370 --> 12:09.080
Hey, you already sent the notice card?

12:09.080 --> 12:10.330
Sorry...

12:10.330 --> 12:11.040
Geez!

12:21.420 --> 12:23.970
Notice

12:21.420 --> 12:23.970
Don't go away!

12:21.420 --> 12:23.970
I'll return right after these messages!

12:21.420 --> 12:23.970
Kaitou Jeanne

12:24.890 --> 12:27.470
Notice

12:24.890 --> 12:27.470
I'm back to continue my adventures

12:24.890 --> 12:27.470
Kaitou Jeanne

12:33.480 --> 12:36.400
Hey, you on the veranda! Move the light a little to the right.

12:37.360 --> 12:40.230
Be careful.

12:43.070 --> 12:44.450
Hiromi...

12:44.450 --> 12:47.660
Don't worry, there's nothing to be afraid of.

12:47.660 --> 12:50.660
You guys are disturbing them. Move to the dining room.

12:51.160 --> 12:55.000
Akita, Fuyuta, take the two of them to the dining room.

12:55.000 --> 12:55.870
Yes, sir!

12:55.870 --> 12:57.130
Please, this way.

12:58.500 --> 13:01.050
Are your guards completely okay?

13:01.050 --> 13:02.880
Of course.

13:02.880 --> 13:05.840
But I don't get it.

13:05.840 --> 13:13.890
Kaitou Jeanne is a thief that only steals paintings and art works that are well-known for their beauty.

13:13.890 --> 13:17.020
Why does she want your daughter's drawing?

13:21.320 --> 13:25.950
But you know, this is the kind of drawing that makes you feel comfortable.

13:27.410 --> 13:29.950
Catch her and ask why she wants it.

13:32.290 --> 13:33.910
Dad!

13:33.910 --> 13:35.750
Oh, Miyako!

13:35.750 --> 13:37.920
Is the trap I asked you about ready?

13:37.920 --> 13:40.880
I had them prepare it as you asked.

13:40.880 --> 13:43.510
It's the Miyako Special, Part Two.

13:43.510 --> 13:45.760
It'll work perfectly tonight, Dad.

13:52.470 --> 13:54.310
Be careful, Maron.

13:54.310 --> 13:58.770
I'll be fine. I don't want Hiromi-chan to have the same sad experiences I did.

13:59.690 --> 14:00.730
Maron...

14:02.230 --> 14:05.280
The Demon that bothers a girl with a beautiful heart is the worst!

14:05.280 --> 14:06.240
Are you ready, Fin?

14:06.240 --> 14:07.150
Y... Yes, yes!

14:16.080 --> 14:18.460
She looks a little too enthusiastic.

14:31.430 --> 14:34.260
<i>Jeanne d'Arc, lend me your power to help Hiromi-chan.</i>

14:45.190 --> 14:47.150
<i>Strong and serious...</i>

14:47.150 --> 14:48.820
<i>Matchless and marvelous...</i>

14:48.820 --> 14:50.410
<i>Energetic and courageous!</i>

15:01.500 --> 15:03.670
So this was also Miyako-san's idea?

15:03.670 --> 15:05.920
That's right.

15:19.430 --> 15:21.480
All right, come on in...

15:46.590 --> 15:48.880
She broke the lights.

15:48.880 --> 15:50.670
Dad, she's approaching.

15:50.670 --> 15:53.010
Natsuda-san, turn on the night vision camera.

15:53.010 --> 15:53.840
Roger!

16:01.980 --> 16:06.150
Great, Miyako. I wouldn't have come up with the night vision camera.

16:06.150 --> 16:07.860
The lights were decoys.

16:07.860 --> 16:10.820
Now she's relaxed and will show herself.

16:10.820 --> 16:13.410
Jeanne, you can come out anytime you want.

16:22.160 --> 16:27.840
Don't worry. Miyako-san's trap is perfect and I'm with you.

16:27.840 --> 16:29.710
What did you say, Harukawa-kun?

16:29.710 --> 16:32.090
That was supposed to be me saying that.

16:32.090 --> 16:35.010
Despite my appearance, I'm very strong.

16:36.970 --> 16:38.970
Don't worry.

16:38.970 --> 16:41.890
Well, there'll be no chance for you to show your stuff.

16:41.890 --> 16:44.980
It's really impossible to enter the house.

16:47.310 --> 16:50.110
Huh? What? What's happening?

16:52.610 --> 16:53.610
It's you, Jeanne!

16:53.610 --> 16:57.280
It's me! It's me! Let me go... ouch...

16:58.120 --> 17:00.660
Lights! Turn on the lights!

17:11.250 --> 17:13.220
Rebound Ball, come out.

17:19.720 --> 17:21.060
<i>Game Start!</i>

17:42.200 --> 17:44.660
I've got you, Kaitou Jeanne.

17:46.120 --> 17:51.090
As I thought, you moved up when you saw the trap at the main entrance.

17:56.880 --> 17:59.220
Kaitou Jeanne, surrender!

17:59.220 --> 18:00.800
You're completely surrounded!

18:04.270 --> 18:06.770
So, how will you take the drawing?

18:11.110 --> 18:14.320
<i>It's impossible. If I go down to the floor, they'll catch me.</i>

18:14.320 --> 18:18.240
<i>At this position, I can't throw the pin.</i>

18:23.660 --> 18:24.750
What should I do?

18:27.750 --> 18:29.420
Fin, what should I do?

18:29.420 --> 18:31.170
What should I do, Fin?

18:31.170 --> 18:33.920
Maron, the ball. You can use the ball.

18:34.380 --> 18:35.960
Well, it can't hurt to try.

18:38.220 --> 18:38.880
What?

18:41.090 --> 18:44.890
In the name of God... You, a Demon, born in darkness...

18:44.890 --> 18:46.770
A bomb?

18:46.770 --> 18:47.730
DUCK!

18:49.890 --> 18:52.150
I seal you here!

19:08.210 --> 19:10.960
<i>Checkmate!</i>

19:21.380 --> 19:22.720
<i>Collection completed!</i>

19:27.600 --> 19:28.520
Miyasaka-san.

19:30.520 --> 19:31.480
Damn it!

19:31.770 --> 19:32.810
Adieu!

19:32.810 --> 19:35.070
Wait, Kaitou Jeanne!

19:35.070 --> 19:39.110
Miyasaka-san, wake up! Miyasaka-san! Miyasaka-san!

19:42.280 --> 19:43.070
What was I...?

19:45.450 --> 19:46.790
Papa!!

19:46.790 --> 19:47.990
Hiromi.

19:47.990 --> 19:49.290
Papa...

19:54.790 --> 19:56.880
The drawing... The drawing's gone!

19:56.880 --> 20:00.550
Crap! Hey, don't let her get away!!

20:01.340 --> 20:04.300
It's not over yet, Jeanne!

20:04.300 --> 20:06.100
- Found anything?

20:05.300 --> 20:06.100
- Not yet.

20:06.100 --> 20:07.850
- How about you?

20:06.890 --> 20:08.180
- Are there any clues?

20:07.850 --> 20:08.180
- None.

20:08.180 --> 20:09.850
Alright, keep searching!

20:09.850 --> 20:11.140
I'll go that way...

20:11.140 --> 20:12.520
Find her! Find her!

20:19.400 --> 20:22.150
Geez, there are guards over here, too...

20:26.160 --> 20:28.410
That was close, Jeanne.

20:37.090 --> 20:40.510
I got her! I got Jeanne!!

20:44.510 --> 20:45.930
That was too easy.

20:46.970 --> 20:52.310
What?! She's not in there! She got away...!

20:52.310 --> 20:57.310
Whaaaaaaaaaat? Again, Miyako-san?!

20:58.690 --> 21:00.360
That was close.

21:06.740 --> 21:10.950
Geez! Every morning it's like this. Can't you get up earlier?

21:10.950 --> 21:13.160
C'mon, hurry up!

21:14.040 --> 21:18.710
I'm still sleepy 'cause I went to bed late last night. I didn't ask you to wait for me!

21:18.710 --> 21:23.670
It's your fault for staying up so late. Being late is a violation of school rules!

21:23.670 --> 21:25.380
Onee-chan!

21:31.720 --> 21:32.640
Hiromi-chan...

21:32.640 --> 21:34.640
Hurry up, Maron, or we'll be late.

21:35.270 --> 21:39.060
Onee-chan, teach me about gymnastics next time!

21:39.060 --> 21:42.440
It's good that she got her kind father back.

21:44.150 --> 21:46.450
If you don't mind, I'll give you a big hug.

21:50.530 --> 21:51.950
Quit joking around.

21:51.950 --> 21:55.410
What are you guys doing? We'll be really late!

21:55.410 --> 21:58.330
Maron, Chiaki, hurry up!

21:58.330 --> 22:03.670
Today, I'm assigned to flower duty!!

22:05.470 --> 22:11.300
For billions of years,

22:11.390 --> 22:20.860
it kept infinite thoughts.

22:23.020 --> 22:29.490
It wakens the memory of the distant past.

22:29.740 --> 22:35.790
A life born in the wild ocean.

22:36.410 --> 22:39.210
The huge mountains...

22:41.920 --> 22:48.840
...emitted white smoke and covered the Sun.

22:49.340 --> 22:53.890
It took everything.

22:56.140 --> 23:02.110
On the deserted land with you,

23:02.190 --> 23:09.110
we watched the world ending...

23:09.320 --> 23:15.160
Someday we'll go beyond space-time...

23:15.290 --> 23:24.960
and I'll wish to meet you again.

23:32.220 --> 23:36.100
Sending a notice to my school... How dare you, Jeanne!

23:36.100 --> 23:40.230
- Miyako... Don't get angry so easily...

23:37.970 --> 23:40.230
- No can do! I'm also a detective's daughter!

23:40.230 --> 23:43.480
In that case, we students are going to catch Jeanne ourselves!

23:43.480 --> 23:45.570
Well... Miyako is excited, but I'm sorry...

23:45.570 --> 23:49.190
I need to help Pakkyamlamao-sensei, who is possessed by a Demon.

23:49.190 --> 23:50.990
I won't go easy on this!

23:50.990 --> 23:55.200
Kamikaze Kaitou Jeanne: The Encircling Net! The Enemy Is the Student Body

23:55.200 --> 23:59.410
Jeanne... I'll definitely catch you!
